# UI-HARVEST-ICON-1 B: the status icon over a forester with nothing to harvest (docs/re/ui.md 11).
# A forester (801, a PLANTAGE farm whose input BAUM is a crop) built on the lan5 developer island
# where no mature tree stands in its 11 x 11 work square: its workers bring nothing back, the raw
# stock stays 0, and after the farm's 60 000-tick "missing input" interval (120 game seconds) the
# sim sets icon bit 1. The window must then carry and draw icon 1 (KeinRohstoff, figure 1570) over
# it. Launch: --play data/maps/lan5.txt --speed 200 (the CMake case adds it).
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
wait frames 5
key b
wait frames 3
select 801
rotate 0
expect title build 801
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
expect fact inspection.type == 801
expect fact inspection.kind == Farm
# Before the interval has passed: no icon.
expect fact inspection.status_icon == none
wait fact inspection.status_icon == 1 within 200000
expect fact inspection.raw_88 == 0
expect fact status_icons.count >= 1
wait fact status_icons.drawn >= 1 within 10000
quit
